===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/'skerʦo/|lang=it}}

===Noun===
{{it-noun|scherz|m|o|i}}

# [[joke]], [[jest]], [[trick]], [[hoax]]
# (''something easy to do'') joke, [[trifle]], [[cinch]]
# {{music|lang=it}} scherzo

